                    insight_resilient:      `Resilient & credible: you solved the triple bind as one system — a phased rail that protected the P&L, abatement-weighted climate spend, and an honest, assured disclosure. The covenant holds, the regulator has nothing, and the journalist's story has no gap to exploit.`,
                    insight_greenwash:      `Greenwashing exposé: cheap, offset-heavy spend and a disclosure that outran your evidence handed the journalist the story. Expect an ACPR/AMF marketing-claims look and impact investors testing the Series C covenant — the cheapest climate spend was the most expensive exposure.`,
                    insight_short:          `You didn't fully reconcile the three decisions. The rail, the climate budget and the disclosure still tell slightly different stories — enough for the covenant test and the press to find the seam.`,
                    insight_pnl_negative:   `Your P&L impact is negative: either the cost swing ate the EBITDA line on expensive cards, or an unmodelled A2A migration churned the volume you were trying to make cheaper. The rail decision dominated the P&L, as it always does on EUR 4.3B.`,
