                    insight_overpromise:    `You over-promised in the disclosure. A public net-zero-by-2030 target your assurer can't sign is a future liability, not a win — over-disclosure is exactly the trap the assurance round is meant to catch.`,
                    insight_unassured:      `CSRD readiness stayed low: too little assurance scope or a disclosure your provider couldn't sign. A report that can't be assured isn't compliant — and the covenant required a credible, externally-assured one.`,
                    insight_trusted:        `Credibility is high and exposure low — the green claim is now substantiated rather than marketed. That is the disclosure-performance gap closed, which is what protects the cost of capital.`,

